# An image that never came through the front door. It carries no knock stamp, no
# SBOM referrer and no signature — so verify.sh fails on it. That failure is the
# point: it is the visible, permanent counter-example to every image beside it.
#
# What never comes through the mandated door is ungovernable. Saying so is cheap;
# standing next to a live instance of it is the argument.
FROM busybox:1.37.0
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.description="Pushed directly, bypassing knock. Deliberately unstamped."
